  (127, 'manhattan', 'Manhattan', '113-1-1-1-1', 26.75, '<p><span>A tribute to the spirited heart of the city. This candle captures the raw, earthy notes of Oakmoss, intertwined with the enigmatic aroma of Smokey Incense. The crisp, green freshness of Cedar Leaves harmonizes with the unique scent of Wet Leaves, evoking the sensation of a rain-kissed urban forest.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Mood: Sophisticated, Grounded</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Scent Notes: Oakmoss, Smokey Incense, Cedar Leaves, Wet Leaves, Soil</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Burn Time: 50-55 hours for 9-10oz., 60-65 hours for 12oz.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>What is our candle constructed with?</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Coconut Soy Wax that burns clean (minimal soot, no smoke, easy to trim)</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Wooden Wicks with crackling sound</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Beautiful Glass Vessels that can double as a fancy cup after use</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Made with fragrances that are Toxic Free / Parabens Free / Phthalate Free / Cruelty Free / Vegan</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>All candles are made in North Dakota</span></p>', array['/images/products/manhattan.jpg']::text[], 'Size', false, null, '[{"min":12,"max":24,"type":"percent","value":10},{"min":25,"max":49,"type":"percent","value":20},{"min":50,"max":null,"type":"percent","value":30}]'::jsonb, array[]::int[]),
  (126, 'sweet-smoke', 'Sweet Smoke', '113-1-1-1', 26.75, '<p><span>A captivating blend of deep, smoky Vetiver and rich Amber. This luxurious candle weaves a tapestry of twilight magic, where the earthy depth of timbers melds seamlessly with a whisper of Vanilla, creating an ambiance of mystery and comfort. Ideal for evenings of reflection or intimate gatherings, After Hours transforms your surroundings into a sanctuary of nocturnal elegance.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Mood: Mysterious, Introspective</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Scent Notes: Smoky Vetiver, Amber, Timbers, Vanilla</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Burn Time: 50-55 hours for 9-10oz., 60-65 hours for 12oz.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>What is our candle constructed with?</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Coconut Soy Wax that burns clean (minimal soot, no smoke, easy to trim)</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Wooden Wicks with crackling sound</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Beautiful Glass Vessels that can double as a fancy cup after use</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Made with fragrances that are Toxic Free / Parabens Free / Phthalate Free / Cruelty Free / Vegan</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>All candles are made in North Dakota</span></p>', array['/images/products/sweet-smoke.jpg']::text[], 'Size', false, null, '[{"min":12,"max":24,"type":"percent","value":10},{"min":25,"max":49,"type":"percent","value":20},{"min":50,"max":null,"type":"percent","value":30}]'::jsonb, array[125]::int[]),
