  (115, 'earl-grey', 'Earl Grey', '114-11-1-', 26.75, '<p><span>At its heart, the comforting aroma of Earl Grey wraps around you, reminiscent of quiet mornings and time spent reflecting. This is elegantly paired with the zesty undertones of Bergamot, known for its uplifting properties and addicting citrus scent. A splash of fresh Cucumber serves as a gentle reminder of nature''s simple serenities. The gentle crackle of the wooden wick, echoing the sounds of a serene fireplace which deepens the meditative experience.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Mood: Calm, Relaxed, Invigorating</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Scent Notes: Bergamot, Earl Grey Tea, Cucumber, Lime, Beeswax, Amber, Musk.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Burn Time: 50-55 hours for 9-10oz., 60-65 hours for 12oz.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>What is our candle constructed with?</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Coconut Soy Wax that burns clean (minimal soot, no smoke, easy to trim)</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Wooden Wicks with crackling sound</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Beautiful Glass Vessels that can double as a fancy cup after use</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Made with fragrances that are Toxic Free / Parabens Free / Phthalate Free / Cruelty Free / Vegan</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>All candles are made in North Dakota</span></p>', array['/images/products/earl-grey.jpg']::text[], 'Size', false, null, '[{"min":12,"max":24,"type":"percent","value":10},{"min":25,"max":49,"type":"percent","value":20},{"min":50,"max":null,"type":"percent","value":30}]'::jsonb, array[]::int[]),
  (114, 'jeju-island', 'Jeju Island', '112-11-1-1', 26.75, '<p><span>A mesmerizing fusion of yuzu, sugarcane, and pomelo scents that will transport you to a citrus paradise. Immerse yourself in the invigorating essence of yuzu, with its zesty and refreshing aroma that awakens your senses. Add the sweetness of sugarcane and the bitterness of pomelo into a wooden wick candle and you''ll get a fusion of bittersweet goodness that is addicting to smell in any occasion.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Mood: Energetic, Fresh</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Scent Notes: Yuzu, Sugarcane, Pomelo</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>Burn Time: 50-55 hours for 9-10oz., 60-65 hours for 12oz.</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>What is our candle constructed with?</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Coconut Soy Wax that burns clean (minimal soot, no smoke, easy to trim)</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Wooden Wicks with crackling sound</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Beautiful Glass Vessels that can double as a fancy cup after use</span><br class="html-br" /><span>- Made with fragrances that are Toxic Free / Parabens Free / Phthalate Free / Cruelty Free / Vegan</span><br class="html-br" /><br class="html-br" /><span>All candles are made in North Dakota</span></p>', array['/images/products/jeju-island.jpg']::text[], 'Size', false, null, '[{"min":12,"max":24,"type":"percent","value":10},{"min":25,"max":49,"type":"percent","value":20},{"min":50,"max":null,"type":"percent","value":30}]'::jsonb, array[]::int[]),
